silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_24_rosetta_stone_cross_domain_sections_04_governance_policy_entry_point_concrete_anchor_2#externalcertificate silm:hasLongDescription "The ExternalCertificate is the external-certification class: a stamped certificate from an accredited vet body (Royal Veterinary College, cert 2026-RVC-11). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'ExternalCertificate', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
